  "cues": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "start": 1.74,
      "end": 7.9,
      "text": "When you land the quarantine process immediately begins they spray down all your bags",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.21279,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.064514
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "start": 8.58,
      "end": 10.58,
      "text": "You have to take a quarantine taxi",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.21279,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.064514
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "start": 11.1,
      "end": 14.58,
      "text": "specifically designated to take you from where you're going to your quarantine I",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.21279,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.064514
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "start": 15.22,
      "end": 20.22,
      "text": "Got to the hotel and we went down into like the the cargo entrance",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.21279,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.064514
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "start": 20.22,
      "end": 25.38,
      "text": "and in it is this like screen with like a person on the other side of a webcam and",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.21279,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.064514
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "start": 25.7,
      "end": 29.1,
      "text": "They just basically told me like take that elevator. Don't touch anything and",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.21279,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.064514
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "start": 30.02,
      "end": 32.54,
      "text": "And we'll like program it to go up to your floor",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.245739,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000588
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "start": 33.26,
      "end": 37.42,
      "text": "This is Ed. I wanted to talk to him because in 2020",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.245739,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000588
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "start": 38.06,
      "end": 46.18,
      "text": "He was one of more than half a million people who went through a mandatory two-week quarantine and then walked out into",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.245739,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000588
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "start": 47.38,
      "end": 57.73,
      "text": "Taiwan Ed has dual citizenship in Taiwan and Canada",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.245739,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000588
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "start": 58.33,
      "end": 63.57,
      "text": "But he lives in New York. I do too and for most of 2020 in New York",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.245739,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000588
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "start": 63.85,
      "end": 67.85,
      "text": "The streets were empty venues were closed",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.313902,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000223
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "start": 68.53,
      "end": 71.21,
      "text": "But Taiwan was normal",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.313902,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000223
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "start": 71.85,
      "end": 73.85,
      "text": "It's as if the pandemic had never happened",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.313902,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000223
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "start": 74.53,
      "end": 76.53,
      "text": "You could go into restaurants",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.313902,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000223
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "start": 77.25,
      "end": 78.93,
      "text": "subway",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.313902,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000223
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "start": 78.93,
      "end": 81.45,
      "text": "Civil society had essentially stayed",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.313902,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000223
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "start": 82.25,
      "end": 83.65,
      "text": "Exactly the same",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.313902,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000223
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "start": 83.65,
      "end": 88.17,
      "text": "Through all of 2020 Taiwan had a total of seven COVID-19 deaths",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.313902,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000223
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "start": 89.09,
      "end": 90.29,
      "text": "seven",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.313902,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000223
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "start": 90.29,
      "end": 94.69,
      "text": "among the lowest in the world and then",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.313902,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000223
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "start": 94.89,
      "end": 96.89,
      "text": "In May of 2021",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.281843,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000925
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "start": 99.54,
      "end": 101.54,
      "text": "Something changed",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.281843,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000925
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "start": 101.74,
      "end": 109.98,
      "text": "Taiwan is now experiencing rising daily infections huge surge largest wave Taiwan is now grappling with its worst outbreak",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.281843,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000925
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "start": 110.46,
      "end": 115.86,
      "text": "After more than a year of normalcy, Taiwan faced its biggest COVID outbreak ever",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.281843,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000925
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "start": 116.54,
      "end": 123.18,
      "text": "So I wanted to understand how did Taiwan stay so safe from COVID-19 for so long",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.281843,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000925
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "start": 124.02,
      "end": 126.02,
      "text": "why did it stop working and",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.281843,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000925
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "start": 127.02,
      "end": 138.23,
      "text": "What can we learn from it through the streets of Taipei a martial parade symbolic of the fighting spirit of nationalist China's army",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.245117,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001242
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "start": 139.67,
      "end": 143.63,
      "text": "Taiwan started out relatively poor and under a military dictatorship",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.245117,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001242
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "start": 144.23,
      "end": 149.95,
      "text": "But by the 1990s it had become a democracy and was experiencing an economic boom",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.245117,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001242
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "start": 150.51,
      "end": 158.31,
      "text": "The government developed the national health insurance system which provided universal health care to 99% of the population",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.245117,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001242
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "start": 158.99,
      "end": 162.59,
      "text": "This put Taiwan on par with wealthy countries around the world",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.221726,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001471
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "start": 163.19,
      "end": 170.59,
      "text": "Well, other than the US in 2001 they began to implement smart cards that stored patients medical information",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.221726,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001471
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "start": 171.23,
      "end": 172.75,
      "text": "digitally that",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.221726,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001471
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "start": 172.75,
      "end": 180.63,
      "text": "Combination of universal health care and the digital infrastructure would come to be regarded as one of the best health care systems in the world",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.221726,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001471
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "start": 183.34,
      "end": 184.86,
      "text": "then in",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.221726,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001471
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "start": 184.86,
      "end": 190.34,
      "text": "2003 China began reporting an outbreak of severe acute respiratory syndrome",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.221726,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001471
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "start": 190.9,
      "end": 194.34,
      "text": "By March 2003 SARS was in Taiwan",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.239793,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000923
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "start": 195.58,
      "end": 199.5,
      "text": "Cases started rapidly appearing in hospitals primarily in Taipei in",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.239793,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000923
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "start": 200.22,
      "end": 204.3,
      "text": "April a large cluster of cases was reported at this hospital in",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.239793,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000923
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "start": 205.54,
      "end": 209.66,
      "text": "Response the mayor of Taipei abruptly decided to seal the hospital off",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.239793,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000923
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "start": 210.66,
      "end": 213.26,
      "text": "preventing anyone from entering or leaving",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.239793,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000923
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "start": 214.26,
      "end": 221.94,
      "text": "More than 150 people trapped inside became infected of the more than 80 people who eventually died of SARS in Taiwan",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.181996,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.005722
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "start": 222.5,
      "end": 225.06,
      "text": "31 had been locked in that hospital",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.181996,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.005722
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "start": 225.98,
      "end": 228.78,
      "text": "The government's response to SARS was chaotic",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.181996,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.005722
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "start": 229.5,
      "end": 236.1,
      "text": "To handle the logistics of the outbreak. They'd set up a temporary agency called the Central Epidemic Command Center",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.181996,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.005722
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "start": 236.74,
      "end": 242.12,
      "text": "But when it came time to figure out who had been responsible for locking down the hospital",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.181996,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.005722
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "start": 242.84,
      "end": 247.96,
      "text": "Officials at all levels of government disagreed on whose decision it had actually been",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.214044,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000579
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "start": 248.4,
      "end": 254.36,
      "text": "We've had a lot of problem of say the municipal government saying one thing and the central government saying another",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.214044,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000579
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "start": 254.8,
      "end": 259.72,
      "text": "So in 2004 the role of the CECC was clarified",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.214044,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000579
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "start": 259.96,
      "end": 265.56,
      "text": "When activated during an outbreak this agency would now become the Central Public Health Authority",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.214044,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000579
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "start": 266.32,
      "end": 269.62,
      "text": "With access to information across government agencies",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.214044,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000579
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "start": 269.74,
      "end": 271.74,
      "text": "We've got a lot of public",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.242535,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000983
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "start": 272.06,
      "end": 275.74,
      "text": "Infrastructure that's made like Lego blocks where people can very easily",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.242535,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000983
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "start": 276.46,
      "end": 279.04,
      "text": "Recombined to produce new functionalities",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.242535,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000983
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "start": 279.82,
      "end": 285.18,
      "text": "Over the next 15 years the CECC was activated during three smaller outbreaks",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.242535,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000983
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "start": 285.7,
      "end": 292.74,
      "text": "But the real test was yet to come on December 31st 2019",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.242535,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000983
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "start": 293.26,
      "end": 299.22,
      "text": "Taiwan's government learned that at least seven atypical pneumonia cases had been reported in Wuhan, China",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.242535,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000983
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "start": 299.58,
      "end": 304.22,
      "text": "And on January 20th, they officially activated the CECC",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.226763,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001186
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "start": 304.7,
      "end": 308.14,
      "text": "Because the CECC could share information across agencies",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.226763,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001186
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "start": 308.14,
      "end": 311.94,
      "text": "It was able to integrate citizens travel data with their health data",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.226763,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001186
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "start": 312.58,
      "end": 317.22,
      "text": "Together that combination allowed them to assess risk at the level of the individual",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.226763,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001186
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "start": 318.38,
      "end": 323.78,
      "text": "People who had recently traveled to countries where they could have been exposed were considered high risk",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.226763,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001186
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "start": 324.26,
      "end": 329.5,
      "text": "People with no underlying health issues who hadn't traveled abroad were considered low risk",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.224712,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.055634
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "start": 330.54,
      "end": 334.06,
      "text": "Everyone in Taiwan had that information sent to their smart card",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.224712,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.055634
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "start": 334.62,
      "end": 337.98,
      "text": "Altogether it created a system that looked something like this",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.224712,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.055634
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "start": 339.1,
      "end": 344.26,
      "text": "Low risk people were instructed to buy a weekly quota of masks allocated by the government",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.224712,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.055634
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "start": 344.38,
      "end": 347.82,
      "text": "But they'd continue to live in a functional normal society",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.224712,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.055634
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "start": 348.1,
      "end": 355.34,
      "text": "High risk people went into a two-week quarantine after which they'd become low risk and could join everyone else",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.208262,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.082092
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "start": 356.1,
      "end": 359.78,
      "text": "Because of this Taiwan didn't have to go into lockdown",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.208262,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.082092
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "start": 360.86,
      "end": 364.7,
      "text": "Community spread among people in Taiwan was very very low",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.208262,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.082092
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "start": 364.98,
      "end": 368.94,
      "text": "But in March cases coming into Taiwan began to rise",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.208262,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.082092
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "start": 369.58,
      "end": 372.46,
      "text": "So Taiwan came up with an additional strategy",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.208262,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.082092
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "start": 375.04,
      "end": 378.48,
      "text": "It started considering everyone flying in to be high risk",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.279936,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.043488
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "start": 378.48,
      "end": 380.48,
      "text": "No matter where they were coming from",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.279936,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.043488
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "start": 380.48,
      "end": 383.84,
      "text": "And most foreign travelers were banned completely",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.279936,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.043488
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "start": 384.4,
      "end": 387.12,
      "text": "That meant a lot more mandatory quarantine",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.279936,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.043488
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "start": 387.84,
      "end": 394.56,
      "text": "To enforce this, the CECC used cell phone location data to see if any travelers left their quarantine block",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.279936,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.043488
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "start": 395.12,
      "end": 399.68,
      "text": "The moment you close the door, you see on the back end there's this huge red scary sign that says",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.279936,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.043488
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "start": 399.68,
      "end": 402.88,
      "text": "You're going to be fined a lot of money if you leave your quarantine",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.279936,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.043488
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "start": 403.04,
      "end": 407.36,
      "text": "You would get texts from the neighborhood police officer",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.152114,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001575
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "start": 407.36,
      "end": 411.44,
      "text": "Whose job it is to call and check in on you every single day, actually twice a day",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.152114,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001575
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "start": 424.42,
      "end": 428.74,
      "text": "For two weeks, the only human contact it had was through a peephole",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.152114,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001575
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "start": 428.74,
      "end": 432.18,
      "text": "When someone came to drop off food or collect his trash",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.152114,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001575
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "start": 435.58,
      "end": 439.74,
      "text": "But then he got to join the nearly 24 million people in Taiwan",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.152114,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001575
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "start": 440.22,
      "end": 442.22,
      "text": "Living normal lives",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.152114,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001575
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "start": 446.34,
      "end": 451.78,
      "text": "This was an alternate universe of what America and the rest of the world had seen all year",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.121313,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001082
    },
    {
      "index": 87,
      "start": 452.34,
      "end": 457.46,
      "text": "The Taiwanese people have been able to just live their lives as if nothing had happened",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.121313,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001082
    },
    {
      "index": 88,
      "start": 457.78,
      "end": 459.78,
      "text": "Like to me, that's freedom",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.121313,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001082
    },
    {
      "index": 89,
      "start": 459.94,
      "end": 465.06,
      "text": "When I started making this video, it was a story about how Taiwan managed to beat COVID",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.121313,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001082
    },
    {
      "index": 90,
      "start": 467.82,
      "end": 474.78,
      "text": "But in May of 2021, a new wave of cases suddenly put Taiwan's success in question",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.121313,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001082
    },
    {
      "index": 91,
      "start": 475.18,
      "end": 478.14,
      "text": "The total number of cases has actually doubled",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.109545,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.004959
    },
    {
      "index": 92,
      "start": 478.14,
      "end": 480.86,
      "text": "More shops are going to be forced to close",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.109545,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.004959
    },
    {
      "index": 93,
      "start": 480.86,
      "end": 483.74,
      "text": "Do not be complacent in the face of a pandemic",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.109545,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.004959
    },
    {
      "index": 94,
      "start": 483.74,
      "end": 485.58,
      "text": "The lesson learned for Taiwanese",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.109545,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.004959
    },
    {
      "index": 95,
      "start": 487.42,
      "end": 489.9,
      "text": "Taiwan had gradually loosened its quarantine system",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.109545,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.004959
    },
    {
      "index": 96,
      "start": 490.46,
      "end": 494.3,
      "text": "Which meant incoming infections started to go unchecked",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.109545,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.004959
    },
    {
      "index": 97,
      "start": 495.18,
      "end": 499.26,
      "text": "As of this video, Taiwan is still getting its outbreak under control",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.109545,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.004959
    },
    {
      "index": 98,
      "start": 500.14,
      "end": 503.26,
      "text": "Thousands of people have been sent through new rounds of quarantine",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.109545,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.004959
    },
    {
      "index": 99,
      "start": 503.98,
      "end": 510.06,
      "text": "But even Taiwan won't be truly safe until the system it built to keep the pandemic out",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.093838,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001871
    },
    {
      "index": 100,
      "start": 510.7,
      "end": 512.7,
      "text": "Is no longer necessary",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.093838,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001871
    },
    {
      "index": 101,
      "start": 512.78,
      "end": 514.78,
      "text": "And the best way we know of to get there",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.093838,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001871
    },
    {
      "index": 102,
      "start": 515.58,
      "end": 517.58,
      "text": "Is to vaccinate",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.093838,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001871
    },
    {
      "index": 103,
      "start": 517.98,
      "end": 523.66,
      "text": "On the flip side, after a very hard year, New York looks kind of normal again",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.093838,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001871
    },
    {
      "index": 104,
      "start": 524.46,
      "end": 528.38,
      "text": "But it's not because we finally figured out how to contain COVID",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.093838,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001871
    },
    {
      "index": 105,
      "start": 529.1,
      "end": 531.1,
      "text": "It's because of the vaccine",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.093838,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001871
    },
    {
      "index": 106,
      "start": 531.5,
      "end": 532.78,
      "text": "This will happen again",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.125149,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.002241
    },
    {
      "index": 107,
      "start": 532.78,
      "end": 535.98,
      "text": "And we can't just be like, oh, well, you know, there was a vaccine, so it's all good",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.125149,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.002241
    },
    {
      "index": 108,
      "start": 536.46,
      "end": 542.3,
      "text": "At the end of all this, even once we're all vaccinated and going to parties again",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.125149,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.002241
    },
    {
      "index": 109,
      "start": 543.1,
      "end": 546.06,
      "text": "We should look at what did Taiwan do right",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.125149,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.002241
    },
    {
      "index": 110,
      "start": 546.62,
      "end": 550.06,
      "text": "So that we don't have to have the same conversation in the future",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.125149,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.002241
    },
    {
      "index": 111,
      "start": 550.54,
      "end": 551.42,
      "text": "Because it is coming",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.125149,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.002241
    },
    {
      "index": 112,
      "start": 552.14,
      "end": 557.26,
      "text": "For more than a year, Taiwan stayed safe and free during a deadly pandemic",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
